  "title": "Assassin’s Creed® Mirage Fire Demon Pack",
  "description": "Summon devilish monsters from the underworld by using your burning weapons to rip the souls from your opponents’ chests. This pack contains an outfit, a sword, a dagger, a mount skin, an eagle skin, and an outfit dye.",
  "longDescription": "Summon devilish monsters from the underworld by using your burning weapons to rip the souls from your opponents’ chests.\n\nThis pack contains an outfit, a sword, a dagger, a mount skin, an eagle skin, and an outfit dye.\n\nFire Demon Outfit: Sets the target on fire after a successful assassination and burns the body away.\nDemon Claw: Setting weapons on fire, this devil’s claw was first described in ancient times.\nDemon Fang: Crafted from the burning fang of a fiery demon, set your enemy on fire.\nMerthykhuwar: A fearsome and terrifying mount that has leapt straight out of nightmares.\nSimurg: This winged dragon is a fearsome airborne companion.\nRed Initiate of Alamut: A gray customization with scarlet red accents.",
